%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12da250283eb4d21bd2b828afb3b8a8d, type: 3}
  m_Name: KillBossQuestFinishDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialogueId: KillBossQuestFinishDialogue
  _dialogueData:
  - lineId: 1
    dialogueLine: "The warlock is dead. But that was just\u2026 the beginning. He
      was talking about the Lord. About some \u201Cfist.\u201D"
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 2
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 2
    dialogueLine: So the rumors are true... He who has been operating from the shadows
      until now is starting to move his pieces. The Dark Lord is awakening.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 3
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 3
    dialogueLine: "He has a \u201Cfist\u201D\u2014five generals of his legions of
      death. One has already fallen. Who are the rest?"
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 4
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 4
    dialogueLine: 'Five kingdoms keep the world in balance: The green thickets of
      the Magic Forest, The burning wasteland of the sands, The depths of the ocean,
      The dark caves of the underworld, And the heart of the human world - the kingdom
      of Elion.'
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 5
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 5
    dialogueLine: And each of them is under threat?
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 6
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 6
    dialogueLine: Yes. Your battle has just begun. Each of the generals is an embodiment
      of anger, greed, or pain. You must defeat them... to finally reach him.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 7
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 7
    dialogueLine: I don't remember who I was before. But now I know who I must become.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 8
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 8
    dialogueLine: "You became a Spark. And that spark was destined to become a flame.
      Farewell, my young friend. I hope we will meet again\u2026 under more favorable
      circumstances."
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Close
      nextLineId: 
      triggerComplete: 1
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  _alternativeDialogue: {fileID: 0}
